       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Danny Bernstein",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785e2552404d0070bf1d34",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>When I do this:</p>\n\n<p>curl -i -X POST \"http://localhost:8080/rest/fcr:tx\" -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin</p>\n\n<p>I get this:</p>\n\n<p>HTTP/1.1 201 Created<br/>\n Expires: Wed, 20 May 2020 23:26:46 GMT<br/>\n Location: <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/fcr:tx/f481b5f7-c019-4f0e-863a-ee0ba44bcaf0*\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/fcr:tx/f481b5f7-c019-4f0e-863a-ee0ba44bcaf0</a><br/>\n Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/fcr:tx/f481b5f7-c019-4f0e-863a-ee0ba44bcaf0*/commit*\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/fcr:tx/f481b5f7-c019-4f0e-863a-ee0ba44bcaf0/commit</a>&gt;; rel=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/transaction#commitEndpoint\" </p>\n\n<p>To commit - I must use the commitEndpoint url:</p>\n\n<p>curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin  -X PUT <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/fcr:tx/b99ca362-d1f3-4cec-91ed-e225efb59346\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/fcr:tx/</a> <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/fcr:tx/f481b5f7-c019-4f0e-863a-ee0ba44bcaf0*/commit*\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">f481b5f7-c019-4f0e-863a-ee0ba44bcaf0/commit</a>\"</p>\n\n<p>I've updated the  documentation accordingly.</p>\n\n<p> </p>",
